# Copy to `.env` for `npm run dev` / `npm run build` in this package.
# Vite inlines VITE_* values into the browser bundle, so only public values
# belong here.
#
# This build does not use Clerk or Razorpay in the browser: bookings are made
# as a guest and confirmed in the Command Deck. Server secrets (DATABASE_URL,
# OBJECT_STORAGE_*, and Razorpay only when PAYMENTS_MODE=razorpay) live in the
# hosting project's environment, never here.

# Optional: absolute API origin when the backend is not same-origin.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
